  "description": "<p>Hello Pal,</p>\r\n<p><br>&nbsp; &nbsp;We are LuckyPals, a small dog-loving business based out of Miami, Florida focused on selling affordable and durable dog toys. We are looking to build a dog-loving community, and we believe that you can help us grow our small business. We would love to offer you an opportunity in gaining some extra cash, in exchange for helping us spread our brand. It is completely free to join and in exchange, you can reach different levels of monetization.</p>\r\n<p><br>We would provide you with a personal link that your audience can click and purchase items from our website. You will begin by earning a 12% commission off of every order that is purchased using your link. After 10 orders, you will move into the 15% commission margin. Following that, after 15 orders you will move into the 17% commission margin and earn 17% commission off of every order. As a bonus, after your first sale, we will ship out our exclusive Lunch Set to you!</p>\r\n<p><br>Our mission is to spread our dog-loving brand so that everyone can have access to high-quality and affordable dog toys!</p>",
